        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>BUNCH</strong> (1.) A bundle of twigs (Exodus 12:22). (2.) Bunch or cake of raisins (2 Samuel 16:1). (3.) The “bunch of a camel” (Isaiah 30:6).",
